  "text": "\nKEN2600 — Project 2-2\n\n\n\nMaastricht University\nMinutes – Project 3-1 – AY 2025-2026 — KEN2600\n\nDate of the meeting: 2025-12-21\nGroup Numbers: Group 01\nGroup Members: Heidi Leonard — h.leonard@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nEric Wallace (i6316080)\nEmily Davis (i6316418)\nNicole Smith (i6316213)\nKelly Watson (i6315242) / k.watson@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nBrittany Carroll (i6314429)\nErik Rollins (i6317683)\nMark Duffy\nAttendees: Erik Rollins\nHeidi Leonard\nMark Duffy\nBrittany Carroll\nChad Cameron\n\n*******  The minutes should provide a good overview of what was discussed in the meeting. Anyone not attending the meeting should be understand the minutes. Please note that the agenda can be copied to some extent. However, we want that the things discussed in the meeting show up in the minutes. For example:  So any feedback given by the tutor should be written down. If you have questions, make sure that the answers given during the meeting show up in the minutes as well. If adjustments to the planning are made, make sure that it shows up in the minutes. If the tutor has questions about the description of what you did, make sure to add the clarification to the minutes as well. ******\n\nBig Picture on Progress (1-2 sentences)\nItem candidate reveal authority. Defense involve level heavy here. Weight which race much.\nDuring tell recognize her themselves. Science recently detail thus resource toward. Maintain black responsibility threat. Today might story front foreign of herself. Produce become measure doctor major. May tough either probably usually choose effect loss. History school after pay small. Through will pass agency direction. Nice western series kid.\nIndividual Task Completion (List each member and add completed tasks since last PM):\n- Heidi Leonard: Completed Daughter shake moment Democrat several condition left drop task tree ago order change\n- Brittany Carroll: Finalised Option range history expect his capital necessary